 "narrative": "Declared 2019 food industry potatoes -> 2020 winter soft wheat -> 2022 winter barley -> 2023 food industry potatoes -> 2024 winter soft wheat -> 2025 winter barley. Untracked years inferred from embeddings (LOYO group acc ~0.9): 2021 ~field veg. 3 crops in 6 declared years, cereal share 67%, longest same-crop run 1y; 1 declared-vs-phenology disagreement(s). After summer harvest the field was green over winter in 0/2 seasons. Season greenness vs same-crop peers within 5 km: mean percentile 0.69 over 6 years (1 bottom-quartile, 4 top-quartile); weak persistence (A3), treat as season outcomes. Within-field: a stable pattern (year-to-year rho 0.83, 6 seasons); 21% of the field is low-vigour in >=60% of seasons (chance 1.7%), concentrated SE. Vigour falls toward lower ground (rho 0.44 vs rotated-DEM null -0.07, relief 0.6 m)."
